WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,120
Why do you not keep your word, little friend?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:03,840
I can always use force

3
00:00:03,840 --> 00:00:05,440
I just want to respect you

4
00:00:05,760 --> 00:00:08,320
The base is a united family, Rona

5
00:00:10,150 --> 00:00:12,670
This kid wants to join our big family

6
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:14,710
But the mood is too exciting

7
00:00:14,710 --> 00:00:15,870
what are you going to do

8
00:00:16,230 --> 00:00:21,250
let me go

9
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,370
Dear leader

10
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,050
I will dedicate my strength to the base

11
00:00:25,050 --> 00:00:32,860
Thank you for agreeing to join me. Thank you.

12
00:00:33,060 --> 00:00:34,700
You just activated your ability and made progress

13
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,190
Do you think I'm cruel?

14
00:00:40,190 --> 00:00:41,710
They are cruel to you too

15
00:00:41,990 --> 00:00:43,510
This is between you

16
00:00:43,510 --> 00:00:44,910
I'm not qualified to judge equally
